# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=gtk3
_lockname=gtk3
pkgver=3.24.49
pkgrel=2
pkgdesc="GTK 3: the toolkit of most Linux desktop programs (Wayland only for now)"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.gtk.org/"
license=(LGPL-2.1-or-later)
depends=(glibc glib cairo pango harfbuzz fribidi gdk-pixbuf libepoxy at-spi2-core wayland libxkbcommon hicolor-icon-theme fontconfig
         libx11 libxext libxi libxrandr libxcursor libxdamage libxfixes libxcomposite)
install=gtk3.install
source=("https://download.gnome.org/sources/gtk/3.24/gtk-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('5ea52c6a28f0e5ecf2e9a3c2facbb30d040b73871fcd5f33cd1317e9018a146e')

build() {
    meson setup gtk-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
        -D x11_backend=true -D wayland_backend=true -D broadway_backend=false \
        -D introspection=false -D man=false -D demos=false -D examples=false \
        -D tests=false -D installed_tests=false -D colord=no -D cloudproviders=false \
        -D tracker3=false -D print_backends=file
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
